~B. The passage is good because it sounds good.#This is imprecise. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
~C. The thing in the text is nice.#This is vague. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
=D. The author uses contrast to emphasize the difference between public truth and secrecy.#Correct. This uses precise academic vocabulary. Notice how the answer uses the exact wording, evidence, or concept required by the standard.
}

